      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "AMRON TOY (8) has a terrific record this track and trip with two wins and two placings from four starts. Recorded a 4.5 lengths win (34.05) in a Grade 4/5 last time at this track. Looks suited here and rates on top. MEPUNGA LARA (1) has a strong record here with six wins and two placings from 13 starts. Was out of placings last time (42.22) at Sandown in a S/E Group 1, finishing fourth and beaten 9 lengths. Looks a key chance on best figures. ESPOIR (6) comes off an average effort last start when fifth at Sandown over 595m behind Ritza Sophie (34.89) in a Grade 4/5. Was in the money the start prior. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. VODKA AND ICE (2) is a last-start placegetter in good time - worth considering.",
